('P002401', 'TEODORES', 'A comfy chair that’s sturdy, yet lightweight and stackable too. An easy match with different tables and styles and eager to please, whether it’s in the dining room, in the entrance or by your bed.\r\n\r\nThe chair is easy to store when not in use, since you can stack up to 6 chairs on top of each other.', 'C0004', 125.00, 20, 'Black', 'Depth: 54cm\r\nWidth: 46cm\r\nHeight: 80cm\r\nSeat width: 40cm\r\nSeat depth: 37cm\r\nSeat height: 45cm\r\nTested for: 110kg', 'Plastic, Steel', , , , NULL);
