('P003601', 'EKENABBEN', 'In EKENABBEN open shelving unit you can store lots of things and easily access them when needed.\r\n\r\nAdapt the storage to your needs with things like boxes and binders.\r\n\r\nThe shelving section is made of untreated wood – so you can freshen it up with sandpaper or paint it to make it more personal.\r\n\r\nEasy to assemble.', 'C0005', 249.00, 30, 'Aspen, Blue', 'Frame, depth: 34cm\r\nFrame height: 154cm\r\nFrame width: 70cm\r\nMax. load/shelf: 20kg', 'Solid Aspen, Steel', , , , NULL);
