('P004201', 'RAKKESTAD', 'Of course your home should be a safe place for the entire family. That’s why a safety fitting is included so that you can attach the wardrobe to the wall.\r\n\r\nPerfect on its own or combined with other wardrobes in the RAKKESTAD series depending on your space and needs.\r\n\r\nSliding doors allow more room for furniture because they don’t take any space to open.', 'C0006', 699.00, 30, 'Black', 'Width: 117cm\r\nDepth: 55cm\r\nHeight: 176cm', 'Particleboard', , , , NULL);
