('P004601', 'FLISBERGET', 'A wardrobe fit for the one that loves folding! A lot of shelving space for most things that can be folded, rolled up or just does not fit in drawers.\r\n\r\nYou can easily adapt this ready-made PAX/KOMPLEMENT combination to suit your needs and taste using the PAX planning tool.\r\n\r\nAdjustable feet make it possible to compensate any irregularities in the floor.\r\n\r\nWith the PAX Planner, you can easily complete your combination with integrated lighting. After choosing the light source, the planner will work out which accessories you need to complete the solution.', 'C0006', 2335.00, 20, 'Light Beige', 'Height: 236.4cm\r\nWidth right: 87.9cm\r\nWidth left: 160.5cm', 'Particleboard, Steel', , , , NULL);
