('P004801', 'BESTA', 'It’s not only the TV that’s smart! BESTA TV benches combine contemporary good looks with practical function. You get lots of storage space and relief from cables that tend to get messy and gather dust.\r\n\r\nA wall-mounted TV bench creates a clean, airy look and there are no legs that get in the way when you vacuum the floor.\r\n\r\nIt’s easy to keep the cables from your TV and other devices out of sight but close at hand, as there are several cable outlets at the back of the TV bench.\r\n\r\nThe cable outlet at the top lets cables run down smoothly into the TV bench.', 'C0007', 605.00, 20, 'Black', 'Width: 180cm\r\nDepth: 42cm\r\nHeight: 38cm\r\nMax. TV weight: 30kg\r\nMax. load/shelf: 20kg', 'Particleboard, Steel', , , , NULL);
