('P004901', 'BRIMNES', 'When it’s tidy by the TV it’s easier to indulge in your favourite TV series. Keep your games, controls and accessories in the large drawers and feed the cables through the outlets in the back.\r\n\r\nThis TV-bench has large drawers that make it easy to keep remote controls, game controllers and other TV accessories organised.\r\n\r\nCable outlets make it easy to lead cables out the back, so they’re hidden from view but close at hand when you need them.', 'C0007', 429.00, 20, 'White', 'Width: 180cm\r\nDepth: 41cm\r\nHeight: 53cm\r\nMax. load: 30kg', 'Particleboard, Glass', , , , NULL);
